        "summary": "Bret encourages his children to use ChatGPT constructively as a personalized tutor and learning utility: to quiz themselves, get explanations in a more suitable format, and work through questions while learning to code. He sees it as a tool to build agency, not merely a device or entertainment app.",
        "summary_citation_ids": [
