        "sections": [
          {
            "heading": "Ways he has his children use it",
            "content": "His children use ChatGPT to quiz themselves before tests, in audio or chat mode; he says this works better than cue cards. His daughter also photographed a page of Shakespeare she did not understand and asked ChatGPT to explain it. When his older daughter was learning to code and building a website, he directed her to ask ChatGPT when she had questions, so she would learn to use the tool herself. He says he is trying to help them use it constructively in their lives.",
            "citation_ids": [
              "S1",
              "S2"
