            "heading": "Ways he has them use it",
            "content": "His children use ChatGPT to quiz themselves before tests, in audio or chat mode; he says it works better than cue cards. His daughter photographed a page of Shakespeare she did not understand and asked ChatGPT to explain it. When his oldest daughter was learning to code and building a website, he directed her to ask ChatGPT when she had questions rather than asking him, so she would learn to use the tool.",
