            "heading": "His broader approach",
            "content": "He wants his children to make AI part of their lives and learn to use it constructively. He sees it as a personalized tutor that can teach through visual, audio, or reading formats, and frames ChatGPT more like a learning utility or Google Search than an addictive phone. He also notes the caveat that AI can help students learn, but can also give students ways to avoid learning.",
